---
import QuoteForm from "../components/QuoteForm.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Beat my price" description="Found a hotel or holiday price on a booking site? Send Udan Tours and Travels the screenshot. We price the same trip at our agent rates and tell you if we can beat it.">
  <section class="bg-udan-orange/5 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 md:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-udan-charcoal md:text-4xl">Beat my price</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-udan-gray">
        Found a hotel or package on a booking site? Send us the price. We have been buying from hotels and suppliers at agent rates since 1997, so for many trips we can offer the same thing for less.
      </p>
      <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><p class="font-semibold text-udan-charcoal">1. Send the price</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-udan-gray">A screenshot, or the site, the hotel or package, the room and the price.</p></li>
        <li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><p class="font-semibold text-udan-charcoal">2. We price the same trip</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-udan-gray">Same dates, same hotel or an equal one, at our supplier rates.</p></li>
        <li class="rounded-xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><p class="font-semibold text-udan-charcoal">3. You decide</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-udan-gray">Your quote shows our price next to theirs. Accept it in your account if it suits you.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-udan-gray">
        We can't beat every price: some sites run promotions below the rates any agent can get. When we can't, we will tell you plainly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6">
    <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-udan-charcoal">Send us the price</h2>
    <QuoteForm screenshotFirst />
  </section>
</Base>
